<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:21px;">Join {{workspaceName}} as an agent</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">{{inviterName}} would like you to help answer live chats for <strong>{{workspaceName}}</strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">As an agent you can pick up conversations from the shared queue, reply to visitors in real time and save your own message shortcuts.</p>
{{> button url=inviteUrl label="Accept invitation"}}
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">This invitation expires in {{expiresIn}}.</p>
